        },
        "quote": "(a) The following method is established for the establishment and certification of neighborhood improvement associations (NIAs):",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.25.050:block:0#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 2.25.050 block 1",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 1,
          "component_id": "8760da84-bcbe-557e-b691-c81bd92d091e",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 311,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.25.050:block:1",
          "start": 129
        },
        "quote": "(1) Persons interested in forming an NIA shall set a time and place for an organizational meeting and notify all residents of this meeting, either by mail or by hand-delivered flier.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.25.050:block:1#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 2.25.050 block 2",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 2,
          "component_id": "ecb5f7c1-b1cd-58b4-8270-2d822b039a92",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 486,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.25.050:block:2",
          "start": 312
        },
        "quote": "(2) At the organizational meeting, boundaries for the NIA shall be determined, officers shall be elected, and a date, time and place for regular future meetings shall be set.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.25.050:block:2#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 2.25.050 block 3",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 3,
          "component_id": "fb4db35a-252d-5aac-a5b1-919af232a118",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 680,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.25.050:block:3",
          "start": 487
        },
        "quote": "(3) At the organizational meeting, a petition shall be signed by at least 25 residents, property owners, businesses and persons having a definable interest in the area requesting certification.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.25.050:block:3#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 2.25.050 block 4",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 4,
          "component_id": "b94a0aac-ce81-5432-a1df-442247aa4f79",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 795,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.25.050:block:4",
          "start": 681
        },
        "quote": "(4) A letter requesting certification and the signed petition shall be submitted to the City Manager for approval.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.25.050:block:4#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 2.25.050 block 5",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 5,
          "component_id": "293b2d3b-2e12-5551-a62e-332cc94aff6c",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 925,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.25.050:block:5",
          "start": 796
        },
        "quote": "(5) The association shall meet during the month of April each year to elect a president, vice-president, secretary and treasurer.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.25.050:block:5#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 2.25.050 block 6",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 6,
          "component_id": "24d61ce3-30da-5f25-bcb9-ed9721b4386e",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1002,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.25.050:block:6",
          "start": 926
        },
        "quote": "(6) A quorum for the transaction of business shall be those members present.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.25.050:block:6#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 2.25.050 block 7",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 7,
          "component_id": "73290329-59b3-5cc4-9da1-d0348f7ef385",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1238,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.25.050:block:7",
          "start": 1003
        },
        "quote": "(7) If an NIA wishes to extend its boundaries, each resident of the area to be included in the expansion shall be notified of the proposed expansion and given the opportunity at the NIA meeting to express their approval or disapproval.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.25.050:block:7#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 2.25.050 block 8",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 8,
          "component_id": "01030c4c-9db6-5ee5-b2a3-8291dbfbf9d7",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1639,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.25.050:block:8",
          "start": 1239
        },
        "quote": "(b) Each year, on or prior to May 1st, the City Manager shall designate certain census tracts or portions thereof within the City as the community development (CD) target area. Neighborhood improvement associations may be established within the target area. They shall be established as set out in subsection (a) of this section. The responsibilities of these CD target area NIAs shall be as follows:",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.25.050:block:8#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 2.25.050 block 9",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 9,
          "component_id": "4aaedd55-6036-5e07-88b7-2a0d7bfd21d9",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1792,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.25.050:block:9",
          "start": 1640
        },
        "quote": "(1) To identify needs, define objectives and express preferences about activities proposed in the community development block grant funding application.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.25.050:block:9#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 2.25.050 block 10",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 10,
          "component_id": "8bc1b704-17b1-503f-affa-5bff029bbc57",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1983,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.25.050:block:10",
          "start": 1793
        },
        "quote": "(2) To act as a vehicle through which individual and group complaints concerning community development program performance are channeled to the Community and Economic Development Department.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.25.050:block:10#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 2.25.050 block 11",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 11,
          "component_id": "59329e9a-9703-5410-8a16-ece33b9d7427",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 2135,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.25.050:block:11",
          "start": 1984
        },
        "quote": "(3) To develop neighborhood improvement plans and submit such plans to the Community Development Advisory Board and Director for funding consideration.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.25.050:block:11#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 2.25.050 block 12",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 12,
          "component_id": "d3e2d7a4-1b68-5dc2-8d6d-11d2c9e91e0f",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 2228,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.25.050:block:12",
          "start": 2136
        },
        "quote": "(4) To otherwise participate in the development of programs related to community betterment.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.25.050:block:12#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 2.25.050 block 13",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 13,
          "component_id": "8f616ddc-fa95-5928-9756-7c5280f49743",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 2343,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.25.050:block:13",
          "start": 2229
        },
        "quote": "(5) To annually elect two representatives to sit on and participate in the Community Development Advisory Council.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.25.050:block:13#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 2.25.050 block 14",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 14,
          "component_id": "b191199e-3dda-58b4-be03-5c82e90456ac",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 2684,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.25.050:block:14",
          "start": 2344
        },
        "quote": "(6) To work directly with the staff of community and economic development on those community development programs existing in the NIA which are funded or sponsored by community development block grant funds. (Ord. 20206 § 8, 9-10-19; Ord. 18382 § 28, 1-25-05; Ord. 18263 § 5, 6-8-04. Code 1981 § 13-7. Code 1995 § 42-5. Formerly 2.105.050.)",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.25.050:block:14#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
